{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "058c1a60141b3c8bb04275be7e464ec628b738f981d84e8803e6d15baa84975d", "ja": "笑顔で駆け出せば", "zh": "只要带着笑容奔跑而出", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "45c1af942c1e80b38676f8bc850a73fc1ed94848358dc35ddd68a6482acfa26a", "ja": "野外ライブ直前、天候のせいで\nリハーサルがあまりできなかったものの、\n客席に精一杯の笑顔を届けようと意気込む\nアイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "这是野外演唱会即将开始前的一幕：虽然因为天气原因没能进行多少彩排，偶像们还是干劲十足，想把最灿烂的笑容带给观众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ac62e69d796b68481d7828f4a8f04013cc67ecb830aca315709a3d20f84b600d", "ja": "（朝ぐずついていた天気も快晴に変わった！\n絶好の野外ライブ日和だな。さて、主役の二人は……）", "zh": "（早上还阴沉沉的天气也放晴了！\n真是最适合举办户外演出的好天气啊。那么，主角的两位呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "9987f2ec34cabcb70b960225e190bbe328430e862e8e6e6512cb3d21437273c0", "ja": "どうかな？　可憐ちゃん。\n新しい衣装、問題ないかな？", "zh": "怎么样？可怜。\n新衣服没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "68a1035fc91e67889b221410f251db3cfa80c1a53c733beaf9e7e62e3c2a0ee6", "ja": "は、はい。とっても、可愛いです……。\n爽やかな色合いが、春香さんにぴったりで……。", "zh": "是、是的。特别可爱……  \n清爽的配色非常适合春香小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "7537438efd50fe3f528251abd249ad3b7bd237436e4f53b56b35be4e0db255b1", "ja": "ありがとう！　でも可憐ちゃんこそばっちりだよ！\nふふっ、美人さんって感じだね♪", "zh": "谢谢！不过可怜也很合适哦！\n呵呵，很有大美人的感觉呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "70ed77c2ab9bff589cadc9f925af388e4f99c0c885d7bc2ac9a9156352c5b13a", "ja": "え、ええっ！？　……私なんか、そんな、全然……！\nあ、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "诶、诶诶！？……像我这样，哪有，完全不是……！\n啊，{$P$}先生……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "206f3f91b8cb49d9a04fca2eb52abdc9fee82e372f2b00f207a71c55a18b125e", "ja": "二人の調子を聞こうと思ったけど……、\nどうやら万全みたいだな！", "zh": "本来想问问你们两人的状态……  \n看来似乎已经万无一失了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "79baeba51271375816e91e1584cf9db09ee74fd599fd6fa0579cb855f452aa75", "ja": "あ、あの、でも……じつは私、リハーサルが\nちゃんと出来なかったのが、不安で……。", "zh": "啊、那个，不过……其实我因为没能好好完成彩排，有点不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a5e7b6f243f374e0d44073a9d42531b5e612bdcc22dd985e4a5e3c6709dddc00", "ja": "ああ、朝は天気がぐずついてたせいで、\nだいぶ駆け足になっちゃったからな……。", "zh": "啊，早上天气不好，排练进行得相当匆忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "a535e7001963ab21c2e0ee0dfbc5d7d057fa654bfbeb8dfacf3840b67aa8d4ba", "ja": "うう……本番で、ちゃんと春香さんに、\nあ、合わせられるといいんですけど……。", "zh": "呜呜……希望正式演出时，能、能好好跟上春香前辈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "44b77eaece0d13d49100383af1edefdf7e6bc8679cfda132d67c94a32510fa07", "ja": "可憐ちゃん。\n私は全然、心配してないよ♪", "zh": "可怜。\n我一点都不担心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "6752fbf84eec51c0aeec2b3e541cc83fd8b7886d0eda57c391817be2dd994da8", "ja": "え……？\nど、どうしてですか……？", "zh": "诶……？\n为、为什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "f1084676935f5f666381f4f0e18203cd00a794278509f4475e3808ded24c765e", "ja": "今日のライブに向けて、いろんな準備をしてきたよね？\nその間、私たちはずっと一緒にいて……。", "zh": "为了今天的演出，我们做了各种准备，对吧？\n在那段时间里，我们一直都在一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "1e0873cafc7cdf34321ebf4feb3af1bdb0299ce875bc2fb411c2ab752898056f", "ja": "それで、わかったの。私、可憐ちゃんとは息がピッタリ\n合うっていうか……すごく自然でいられるな～って！", "zh": "所以我明白了。我和可怜酱特别合拍，或者说……在一起时感觉特别自然～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "83ed9b8fee1dc0cf0d2d49efe661f78dbf0f87791b068cc8c8324d6811d44577", "ja": "春香さん……。", "zh": "春香小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "c7137c756d78467f9fa32d0a72ab2948f61d9e362fe07676e94092cceedbc423", "ja": "ああ、でも、私っておっちょこちょいだから、\n可憐ちゃんに迷惑かけちゃうかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "啊，不过我这个人比较冒冒失失的，说不定会给可怜添麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "ce31529ad34dfeba47d19e9f5b2d4a3f7fe183b28cafd5130830076a467320ba", "ja": "一生懸命頑張るね！　だから今日のステージ、\n最後まで、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我会努力加油的！所以今天的舞台，也请一直支持到最后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "1751fa5cc35698682db1476bd00a21e5eae16ab1f55fe3323f46da213adb3cfe", "ja": "そ、そんな……！\nわ、私の方こそ、あの……よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "不、不是……！\n我、我才是，那个……请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "822fc43e9a48bcb0e5d4c2788ba054ef4f773cd5d64c7197b8e674f1985f712a", "ja": "……たしかに二人は、息が合ってるみたいだな。\n組んでもらって正解だったよ。", "zh": "……确实，你们两个配合得很默契。\n让你们组队是正确的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "bfa1642bd2844c6a2e1a16c03e41b36f7f0a72d1a0d01fdc2f959a98c158b803", "ja": "……えへへ♪", "zh": "……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
