{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "558467d830eb9dd36cbfb865c10712f8f5384c1a85ca7dfc77ca2e27cef1248b", "ja": "さて、そろそろ時間だ。\n春香、可憐、スタンバイたのむ！", "zh": "好了，差不多到时间了。\n春香、可怜，准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
