{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "f03a5427d49686c4bc6fa2f518ad0e947f5b52e31075cbc3db9d3c707a132ea6", "ja": "すう、はあ……。\nえへへ、やっぱり緊張しちゃうね。", "zh": "吸、呼……。\n嘿嘿，果然还是会紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "13758d31e1dc71b6868e99fd719e9d27d344c76a22eef8cc9318ed911f21a606", "ja": "え？　は、春香さんも緊張、するんですか……？", "zh": "诶？春、春香小姐也会紧张吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "a2c2b7f64edc4d77d423e4a5eda4119d341d014b8c0cf1cf011794872a2e9ff9", "ja": "ええっ！？　もちろんだよ～。ステージの前は、\nいつも緊張するよ？　ちゃんとやらなくちゃ～って。", "zh": "诶！？当然会紧张啦～。每次上台前，我都会紧张的哦？会想着“可得好好表现才行～”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "f669b6966995cc96694870ff7438810a6e458ec829eb9f333546150ce7eab834", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか……。\n春香さんも、同じなんですね……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊……。\n春香也和我一样呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1027_001har", "source_sha256": "489518375db3ebda1b977d2cf496fbcf1dcc17bb50a547ddd11f5da139263e39", "ja": "あ、でも……今日は平気なほうかな？\nふふっ、可憐ちゃんと一緒だから♪", "zh": "啊，不过……今天应该还算没问题吧？\n嘿嘿，因为有可怜陪着我嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "257a79d277b1bdb74f455b56f4eaa1d651055e5fd77831646f5b85668b89fdd9", "ja": "春香さん……。は、はいっ、私もです！\n今日は春香さんと一緒だから……。", "zh": "春香小姐……。那、那是当然的，我也是！\n今天因为有春香小姐陪着……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "8cffbac514abf3296f3a5684c4f64a1ff18fbadeb749b9f7b1e1fea7f16ef47d", "ja": "い、いつもより、笑顔で歌えそうです♪", "zh": "因、因为今天和春香小姐在一起……我好像能比平时更面带笑容地唱歌了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "c0890e45d34ef53a3ae46976c8b7843a52c2e2bbe6f58a9100d41fc4e37ee843", "ja": "よかった！　それじゃ、行こう可憐ちゃん！\nふたりでみんなに、笑顔を届けに！", "zh": "太好了！那我们走吧，可怜！\n两个人一起把笑容传递给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "b485543fa421cccb8f57908dec1b1cb773900d3bbc2ff0415edd79ebc9721a12", "ja": "はいっ、春香さん♪", "zh": "好——，春香小姐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_107_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_107_fc_01_1032_001har", "source_sha256": "caf8933276f6e43d3a4e963c920d354e46f5e072cf76234bf6936c9e4c4b8dfc", "ja": "みなさーん！　聞いてくださーい！\n最初の曲は……。", "zh": "大家——！请听好啦——！\n第一首歌是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
